sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React UI
    participant GW as Go Gateway
    participant ROS as ROS2 star_spi_bridge
    participant LINK as HARQ + FEC + CRC32 link
    participant RX as RX72N firmware (ThreadX)
    participant MOTOR as GPTW PWM + DRV8263H

    UI->>GW: gRPC-Web SetVelocityRequest(4 motors, m/s)
    GW->>ROS: gRPC SetVelocityRequest
    ROS->>LINK: serialize nanopb VelocityCommand
    LINK->>LINK: SYNC 0x55AA + seq + CRC-32 framing
    LINK->>LINK: convolutional FEC K=7, rate-1/2 encode
    LINK->>RX: SPI frame (100 Hz command rate)
    RX->>LINK: ACK with next-expected seq
    LINK->>LINK: Chase Combining if retx needed
    LINK->>ROS: decoded OK

    RX->>MOTOR: 250 Hz PID -> GPTW duty cycle
    MOTOR->>RX: MTU/TPU quadrature tick updates

    loop 100 Hz telemetry
        RX->>LINK: EncoderData + MotorStatus + IMU + sonar
        LINK->>ROS: decoded frame
        ROS->>GW: /odom/unfiltered, /imu/data, /joint_states
        GW->>UI: WebSocket telemetry push
    end

    Note over LINK: Peak utilization 1.6% at 10 Mbps -<br/>FEC overhead headroom available for<br/>future camera-derived sensor streams
